---
/** Option controls for the metadata remover, shared by the tool page and its landing pages. */
---
<div class="field">
  <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="keep-icc" checked /> Keep color profile (ICC)</label>
  <span class="small muted">Recommended. Removing it can shift colors.</span>
</div>
<div class="field">
  <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="apply-orientation" checked /> Apply orientation to sideways photos</label>
  <span class="small muted">A sideways JPG is re-encoded at quality 95 (without its color profile) so it still displays upright. Untick to copy every file unchanged; a sideways photo may then show sideways.</span>
</div>
